sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Browser user
    participant Edge as Ingress
    participant Dash as Dashboard
    participant RF as VM Redfish
    participant M as Manager
    participant Q as QEMU
    User->>Edge: HTTPS + opaque session / CSRF on mutation
    Edge->>Dash: Exact workload mTLS
    Dash->>Dash: Verify session / VM visibility / action role
    Dash->>RF: Exact-VM mTLS + server-stored user ID token
    RF->>RF: Verify workload peer AND user authorization
    RF->>M: Bounded local control operation
    M->>Q: Typed private QMP command
    Q-->>M: Result / independent events
    M-->>RF: Typed outcome
    RF-->>Dash: Redfish response
    Dash-->>User: Authorized result
    Note over Dash,RF: Workload identity does not replace the human role
